title: "ATLAS: Adversarial, Traceable, Latent-Criterion, Auditable, and Seed-Calibrated Task Acceptance (MRF-2026-01 reproducibility data)"
abstract: >-
  Per-rollout aggregate records and a self-contained verification script
  behind Montana Research Foundation preprint MRF-2026-01. Task families, raw
  agent transcripts, and held-out grading data are withheld under
  contamination control (WITHHELD.md).
